### AmbatuFit STB Microservice - REST Client Tests
### Ganti host di bawah ini sesuai lingkungan (Lokal vs STB Gateway Port 80 vs Cloudflare Tunnel)
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
# @baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1
# @baseUrl = https://ambatufit.stei.fun

### 1. Health Check (STB Gateway / Core / Cloudflare /api/*)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. System Capabilities Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/capabilities
Accept: application/json

### 3. Register User Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user.baru@ambatufit.local",
  "password": "PasswordKuat123!"
}

### 4. Login User (Mendapatkan Token Bearer)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pengguna.demo@ambatufit.local",
  "password": "DemoPass123!"
}

### Simpan token dari respon login
@authToken = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### 5. Cek Profil Pengguna (Auth / Me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Ambil Profil Kesehatan Pengguna
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Perbarui Profil Kesehatan
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age_years": 23,
  "sex_for_model": "M",
  "health_goal": "active_lifestyle",
  "dietary_preferences": ["balanced_meals", "high_protein"],
  "activity_preferences": ["running", "bodyweight"],
  "known_conditions": []
}

### 8. Ambil Katalog Gejala Terstruktur (DDXPlus Evidence Catalog)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assessments/evidences
Accept: application/json

### 9. Kirim Penilaian Gejala (Normal - Official DDXPlus Evidence Codes)
# @name assessmentNormal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "evidence_entries": [
    {
      "evidence_code": "E_201",
      "value": true
    },
    {
      "evidence_code": "E_91",
      "value": true
    }
  ],
  "duration_days": 2,
  "notes": "Batuk disertai demam ringan."
}

### 10. Kirim Penilaian Gejala (Indikator Bahaya - Official DDXPlus E_14 + E_66)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "evidence_entries": [
    {
      "evidence_code": "E_14",
      "value": true
    },
    {
      "evidence_code": "E_66",
      "value": true
    }
  ],
  "duration_days": 1,
  "notes": "Nyeri dada saat istirahat disertai sesak napas signifikan."
}

### 11. Riwayat Penilaian Gejala
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assessments?limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 12. Dapatkan Panduan Kesehatan Personal (Deterministik + Integrasi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/guidance
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 13. Catat Entri Pemantauan (Progress Monitoring)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/monitoring/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "wellbeing_note": "Kondisi lutut mulai membaik setelah istirahat dan kompres es.",
  "symptom_tags": ["E_JOINT_OR_MUSCLE_PAIN"]
}

### 14. Riwayat Pemantauan Kebugaran
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/monitoring/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 15. Direktori Tenaga Profesional (Dokter / Ahli Gizi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/professionals?specialty=doctor
Accept: application/json

### 16. Lihat Slot Jadwal Konsultasi Dokter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/professionals/pro-doc-001/slots
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 17. Pesan Konsultasi Dokter
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "professional_id": "pro-doc-001",
  "slot_id": "slot-doc-1"
}

### 18. Lihat Janji Konsultasi Saya
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 19. Partner API: Konsumsi Direktori Dokter oleh Mitra
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/partner/professionals?specialty=doctor
X-API-Key: move-sec-key-456

### 19b. Partner API: Rekomendasi Aktivitas Fisik (Normal vs Kondisi Cedera)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/partner/recommendations/physical-activity?health_goal=active_lifestyle&activity_preference=running&has_injury=false
X-API-Key: move-sec-key-456

### 19c. Partner API: Pemeriksaan Awal Keluhan Nyeri / Cedera & Rekomendasi Aksi
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/partner/injury-check
X-API-Key: move-sec-key-456
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "external_user_ref": "move-user-001",
  "complaint": "Lutut sakit dan bengkak setelah bermain futsal",
  "body_part": "knee",
  "pain_scale": 7,
  "duration_days": 2,
  "occurred_during_activity": "futsal",
  "symptoms": ["bengkak", "nyeri_saat_menumpu"]
}

### 19d. Partner API: Daftar Booking Konsultasi Mitra
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/partner/bookings
X-API-Key: move-sec-key-456

### 20. Katalog Informasi Obat Bebas & Obat Bebas Terbatas (Edukatif)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/medications?limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 21. Detail Informasi & Keamanan Obat Terverifikasi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/medications/opaque-reviewed-entry-id
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 22. Informasi Obat Terkait Penilaian Gejala (Rule-Based & Safety-Gated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assessments/{{assessmentNormal.response.body.id}}/medication-information
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


